1
00:00:41,541 --> 00:00:42,834
HIERARCHY

2
00:01:15,992 --> 00:01:16,826
Hm?

3
00:01:18,453 --> 00:01:20,830
Good morning. Sarap tulog mo?

4
00:01:32,050 --> 00:01:33,259
Gumising ka na, huy.

5
00:01:42,227 --> 00:01:43,144
Sarap tulog mo?

6
00:01:44,229 --> 00:01:45,063
Mm.

7
00:01:59,244 --> 00:02:00,537
Wag kang male-late ah.

8
00:02:04,999 --> 00:02:06,376
Sige, sa school na lang.

9
00:02:06,584 --> 00:02:07,418
Oo.

10
00:02:27,981 --> 00:02:32,026
EPISODE 2
SECRET: WITHIN A SECRET

11
00:02:41,828 --> 00:02:42,620
Mag-break na tayo,

12
00:02:43,538 --> 00:02:44,080
Kim Ri-an.

13
00:04:22,178 --> 00:04:23,429
Ayos lang ba kayo?

14
00:04:23,763 --> 00:04:24,722
Ipamigay 'yan.

15
00:04:31,145 --> 00:04:32,188
Salamat, Chairwoman An.

16
00:04:34,148 --> 00:04:36,609
'Kala ko hanggang next month pa kayo wala.

17
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:41,155
Ri-an, anak ko. Okay ka naman ba?

18
00:04:42,031 --> 00:04:44,659
Hindi naman pala 'ko magtatagal
sa Singapore, kaya napaaga 'ko.

19
00:04:44,742 --> 00:04:46,995
Ikaw? Kumusta ang pag-aaral?

20
00:04:47,578 --> 00:04:50,373
Huling taon mo na,
magugulat tayo college ka na.

21
00:04:52,417 --> 00:04:55,086
Ang bilis mong lumaki,
anak. Nakakamiss 'yung dati.

22
00:04:56,921 --> 00:04:57,797
Second year ako.

23
00:04:58,673 --> 00:04:59,465
Hm?

24
00:04:59,632 --> 00:05:01,592
May isang taon pa bago ako makapagtapos.

25
00:05:03,386 --> 00:05:04,470
E 'di maganda.

26
00:05:04,804 --> 00:05:06,848
Sa college? Naisip mo na
ba kung sa'n mo gusto?

27
00:05:06,931 --> 00:05:09,267
Sa 'kin… sa UK pinakamaganda.

28
00:05:11,811 --> 00:05:13,062
I-resched natin ang lakad ko.

29
00:05:13,146 --> 00:05:14,188
Yes, ma'am.

30
00:05:20,361 --> 00:05:23,906
Lunch with the board nang
12, 2PM, Jooshin Gallery.

31
00:05:24,407 --> 00:05:27,869
4PM, Jooshin Hotel. Tapos may iba pa ba?

32
00:05:28,369 --> 00:05:30,330
May meeting kayo ni Director An.

33
00:05:30,413 --> 00:05:32,582
Magkikita kami saglit pagkatapos ng lunch.

34
00:05:32,665 --> 00:05:33,458
Opo.

35
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:35,585
Okay sa London, panahon
lang ang 'di maganda.

36
00:05:35,668 --> 00:05:38,588
Pumili ka ng college do'n,
Ri-an. 'Di mo 'yon pagsisishan.

37
00:05:38,671 --> 00:05:40,423
Tatlong buwan tayong 'di nagkita,

38
00:05:40,506 --> 00:05:43,217
higit isang taon na tayong
'di kumakain nang sabay.

39
00:05:43,301 --> 00:05:46,512
Wala ba kayong pakialam kung okay lang
ako, kung kumakain nang maayos,

40
00:05:46,596 --> 00:05:47,680
o kung nasasaktan ba?

41
00:05:48,181 --> 00:05:52,226
Sa edad kong 'to, kailangan
ko pa rin ang mga magulang ko.

42
00:05:53,311 --> 00:05:55,897
Ano ulit ang nasa staff
na nag-aalaga sa anak ko?

43
00:05:56,022 --> 00:05:58,191
Tutors, personal assistants,
health specialists,

44
00:05:58,274 --> 00:06:00,485
nutritionists. 15 silang lahat, ma'am.

45
00:06:01,694 --> 00:06:03,321
Anong klaseng aruga pa ang kulang?

46
00:06:11,704 --> 00:06:15,375
Mag-set ng meeting with
President Ryu bago ang board meeting.

47
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:16,334
Opo, ma'am.

48
00:06:45,363 --> 00:06:46,114
Oh--

49
00:06:46,948 --> 00:06:47,490
Tae-ho!

50
00:06:48,574 --> 00:06:49,409
Huy!

51
00:06:50,201 --> 00:06:52,245
-Oh, si Tae-ho! Si Tae-ho 'yon.
-Hey! Andito ka na pala!

52
00:06:52,328 --> 00:06:54,372
-Hi, Tae-ho!
-Sino ka ba?

53
00:06:54,872 --> 00:06:55,665
Pucha kang scholar ka.

54
00:06:55,748 --> 00:06:56,874
Ba't hinahawakan mo 'ko?

55
00:06:57,708 --> 00:06:59,460
-Uy, tingnan n'yo. Ano'ng nangyayari do'n?
-Si Tae-ho 'yon, 'di ba?

56
00:06:59,544 --> 00:07:00,253
-Ano'ng nangyayari?
-Pa'nong magkakilala sila?

57
00:07:00,336 --> 00:07:00,962
Oy, Tae-ho.

58
00:07:01,796 --> 00:07:02,588
Ano'ng meron?

59
00:07:02,839 --> 00:07:03,464
Kilala n'ya ba 'yang scholar na 'yan?

60
00:07:03,548 --> 00:07:05,049
-Hindi ah. Tingnan mo oh.
-Nag-away ba sila?

61
00:07:05,133 --> 00:07:05,883
Wow~.

62
00:07:06,759 --> 00:07:08,970
Nako naman. Wala ka ba
talagang kaalam-alam?

63
00:07:09,053 --> 00:07:09,720
Kilala mo s'ya?

64
00:07:09,804 --> 00:07:10,638
Uy, malabo 'yon ah.

65
00:07:11,431 --> 00:07:13,474
Anak ng may-ari ng
Jaeyul Hotel kilala s'ya?

66
00:07:13,558 --> 00:07:14,809
Hoy, scholar.

67
00:07:15,143 --> 00:07:17,228
Dito hindi tayo magkakaibigan lahat.

68
00:07:18,855 --> 00:07:19,856
Natawa.

69
00:07:19,939 --> 00:07:22,817
Aba~. Dati 'di nga makatingin sa 'min
'yung mga tulad mo eh. Kung makatapik ka

70
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:24,569
-sa balikat n'ya…
-Tumawa pa.

71
00:07:24,777 --> 00:07:27,905
Kawawa naman si Tae-ho. Baka
maagnas 'yung balikat no'n.

72
00:07:27,989 --> 00:07:31,993
-Du-dum! Du-dum, du-dum!
-Nandito s'ya? Seryoso?

73
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:34,787
Lagot s'ya kay Ri-an, baka
magka-unboxing ng intestines n'ya.

74
00:07:34,871 --> 00:07:36,622
Iba rin 'tong lalakeng 'to eh.

75
00:07:36,706 --> 00:07:38,541
Pero ano ba'ng nangyari nu'ng gabing 'yon?

76
00:07:38,624 --> 00:07:41,461
Di ba nakatayo lang si Jae-i
nu'ng… hinalikan s'ya no'n?

77
00:07:41,544 --> 00:07:42,670
May something kaya sa kanila?

78
00:07:42,753 --> 00:07:46,048
Si Jae-i at isang hamak na
scholar lang? Imposible.

79
00:07:46,174 --> 00:07:47,216
Di ba, He-ra?

80
00:07:49,635 --> 00:07:50,803
Posible rin naman, ah.

81
00:07:51,304 --> 00:07:54,515
Scholar man s'ya o hindi,
basta ba gusto s'ya ni Jae-i.

82
00:07:54,765 --> 00:07:55,933
Nakakabilib nga 'yon eh.

83
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:59,937
Yung meron kang tapang na magkagusto
sa sinuman nang walang panghuhusga.

84
00:08:00,021 --> 00:08:02,106
Talaga? So… gano'n ka rin, He-ra?

85
00:08:02,607 --> 00:08:03,858
Kahit sino basta gusto mo?

86
00:08:03,941 --> 00:08:04,984
Iba ako ha.

87
00:08:05,318 --> 00:08:08,571
Una, - 'di ako naa-attract sa mas
mahina at hindi ko kasing yaman.

88
00:08:08,654 --> 00:08:10,031
Gano'n talaga 'ko eh.

89
00:08:10,406 --> 00:08:12,116
Ah? 'Yan. Ayan na s'ya.

90
00:08:40,645 --> 00:08:42,230
Hindi magandang galitin sila.

91
00:08:42,730 --> 00:08:44,857
Totoo lahat 'yung - sinabi ni Chan-min.

92
00:08:45,191 --> 00:08:48,194
Namatay 'yung scholar dahil
napag-initan s'ya ni Ri-an.

93
00:08:48,277 --> 00:08:53,282
Hit-and-run daw. Pero tumakbo talaga s'ya
sa kalsada dahil takot s'yang ma-bully.

94
00:08:54,534 --> 00:08:56,869
Yon o may nanadyang gawin sa kanya 'yon.

95
00:08:57,161 --> 00:09:00,206
Ano ba'ng ginawa n'ya para
pag-initan s'ya ni Ri-an?

96
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:01,958
Dahil kay Jae-i.

97
00:09:02,458 --> 00:09:04,502
Nangahas s'yang makipagkaibigan kay Jae-i.

98
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:05,545
Ha? Dahil lang 'yon do'n?

99
00:09:05,628 --> 00:09:07,713
"Dahil lang do'n"?
Girlfriend s'ya ni Ri-an.

100
00:09:07,797 --> 00:09:11,175
Ang kahinaan n'ya. 'Yon si Jae-i
sa kanya. Do'n s'ya mapipikon.

101
00:09:45,001 --> 00:09:46,043
May tanong lang ako.

102
00:09:46,544 --> 00:09:48,337
Sumusobra ka na, ah. Sa harap ko talaga?

103
00:09:48,421 --> 00:09:49,505
Ano'ng sinasabi mo?

104
00:09:50,715 --> 00:09:51,382
Yung halik?

105
00:09:54,135 --> 00:09:56,304
"Mag-break tayo." "Let's be friends."

106
00:09:56,721 --> 00:09:58,681
Nilinaw ko sa 'yo ang feelings ko.

107
00:09:58,931 --> 00:10:01,976
Kaya sinuman ang gustuhin
ko at anuman ang gawin ko…

108
00:10:02,435 --> 00:10:03,644
wala ka nang pakialam do'n.

109
00:10:03,769 --> 00:10:04,729
Gusto mo s'ya?

110
00:10:05,855 --> 00:10:06,772
Yung scholar na 'yon?

111
00:10:08,524 --> 00:10:09,483
Ano kaya talaga?

112
00:10:10,276 --> 00:10:13,487
Yung totoong dahilan kaya
nakikipag-break ka sa 'kin.

113
00:10:13,571 --> 00:10:15,990
Gumamit ka pa ng aanga-angang scholar.

114
00:10:17,325 --> 00:10:19,535
Yung paliwanag na pilit mong tinatago…

115
00:10:19,785 --> 00:10:21,829
Kailangan kong malaman, Jung Jae-i.

116
00:10:22,663 --> 00:10:26,250
At dahil d'yan, ano kaya'ng
gagawin ko mula sa puntong 'to?

117
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:31,297
Gagawin ko kahit ano, sa
kahit ano pang pamamaraan,

118
00:10:33,924 --> 00:10:35,885
hanggang sa malaman ko
kung ano'ng tinatago

119
00:10:35,968 --> 00:10:39,764
mo sa 'kin at hanggang sa makabalik
ka sa tama mong kinalalagyan.

120
00:10:58,115 --> 00:11:00,451
Ako'ng bahala sa gagong 'yon, patago lang.

121
00:11:00,534 --> 00:11:03,287
Wag mo nang itago.
Durugin mo, lumpuhin mo.

122
00:11:04,872 --> 00:11:09,335
Kailangan n'yang malaman ang nangyayari sa
mga taong nakikialam sa kung anong akin.

123
00:11:09,418 --> 00:11:13,047
Di ba dapat yata mag-lie low
muna tayo? Kamamatay lang nu'ng--

124
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:19,053
Sige, ako'ng bahala.
Tuturuan ko ng leksyon.

125
00:11:22,973 --> 00:11:24,308
Mula ngayon!

126
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:29,355
Lahat ng gagong makikipagkilala sa
bagong scholar o kakausap sa kanya…

127
00:11:30,022 --> 00:11:31,941
ituturing na kapantay n'ya lang.

128
00:11:32,858 --> 00:11:33,943
Chan-min.

129
00:11:35,528 --> 00:11:38,114
'Di ka na dapat inuutusan sa gan'to.

130
00:11:38,447 --> 00:11:40,700
Pucha naman, kailangan ko ba
talagang ipaliwanag sa 'yo lahat?

131
00:11:40,783 --> 00:11:42,952
Uh-- nakakahiya senior mo
pa naman ako, Yun-seok.

132
00:11:43,035 --> 00:11:46,706
Ang totoo, nag-iisip na nga 'ko
ng plano para bugbugin s'ya eh.

133
00:11:54,839 --> 00:11:55,589
Uh, kasi…

134
00:11:56,382 --> 00:12:00,052
Ngayon lang ako nakakita ng
nagpaplano ng ganyan na harap-harapan.

135
00:12:00,136 --> 00:12:01,220
Eh kayo?

136
00:12:01,303 --> 00:12:03,681
Pssh, tang ina mo, gusto mo nang mamatay?

137
00:12:05,850 --> 00:12:07,643
Sabi ni Choi Yun-seok
'wag mo 'kong kausapin,

138
00:12:07,727 --> 00:12:09,353
'di ba? Hindi mo ba narinig 'yon?

139
00:12:10,062 --> 00:12:11,147
Talagang siraulo 'to ah…

140
00:12:11,272 --> 00:12:12,106
Ah!

141
00:12:15,109 --> 00:12:17,945
Chan-min, kung meron ka mang
dapat sapakin dito, hindi ako 'yon.

142
00:12:18,028 --> 00:12:18,863
Hoy!

143
00:12:19,530 --> 00:12:20,364
-Si Choi Yun-seok dapat 'yon.
-Hoy!

144
00:12:20,448 --> 00:12:21,657
-Aray!
-Hmm?

145
00:12:21,741 --> 00:12:23,784
Aray! Buto ko! Pucha!

146
00:12:23,868 --> 00:12:24,869
Tang ina mo ka!

147
00:12:25,369 --> 00:12:26,829
Ano pa'ng ginagawa n'yo d'yan?

148
00:12:29,123 --> 00:12:30,458
Ugh, 'tang ina talaga…

149
00:12:33,878 --> 00:12:34,962
Tang ina ka!

150
00:12:36,130 --> 00:12:37,506
Ano'ng nangyayari dito?

151
00:12:40,676 --> 00:12:41,594
Third year ka, ah?

152
00:12:42,595 --> 00:12:43,846
Ano'ng ginagawa mo dito?

153
00:12:45,890 --> 00:12:47,600
Puta, nakakahiya.

154
00:12:54,523 --> 00:12:56,609
May maikling announcement lang ako.

155
00:12:56,692 --> 00:12:59,612
May Healing Forest ngayong
taon tulad ng napagplanuhan.

156
00:12:59,695 --> 00:13:02,615
Ipo-post 'yung notice sa
group chat, i-check n'yo.

157
00:13:02,698 --> 00:13:06,243
Kung meron mang hindi
makaka-attend, sabihan n'yo ako agad.

158
00:13:06,827 --> 00:13:07,661
Yon lang.

159
00:13:15,503 --> 00:13:16,378
Jae-i.

160
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:21,383
Puwede bang - mag-usap tayo saglit?

161
00:13:24,595 --> 00:13:25,429
Sige.

162
00:13:28,098 --> 00:13:30,309
Sabihin mo na, okay lang na nand'yan s'ya.

163
00:13:34,104 --> 00:13:34,939
Magsalita ka na.

164
00:13:39,026 --> 00:13:41,237
Sorry sa - ginawa ko no'n.

165
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:46,534
-Kung nabigla ka o kung na-offend ka man--
-Scholar.

166
00:13:46,617 --> 00:13:47,785
Kang Ha. 'Yun sana.

167
00:13:49,328 --> 00:13:50,955
Wag sana "scholar", Kang Ha.

168
00:13:51,163 --> 00:13:54,750
Anuman ang pangalan mo, nagsaya lang
tayo nu'ng party. 'Wag kang OA d'yan.

169
00:13:54,834 --> 00:13:57,044
Ayoko sa lahat 'yung mga taong clingy.

170
00:13:57,545 --> 00:13:59,380
Ah, konting advice lang.

171
00:14:00,089 --> 00:14:03,384
Makinig kang mabuti.
Kapalit ng damit na pinahiram mo.

172
00:14:08,973 --> 00:14:09,932
Mag-drop out ka na.

173
00:14:10,057 --> 00:14:11,100
Mag-drop out?

174
00:14:12,059 --> 00:14:13,477
Bakit ko naman gagawin 'yon?

175
00:14:13,811 --> 00:14:17,898
Hinamon mo si Ri-an, 'yon lang ang
paraan para hindi ka n'ya masaktan.

176
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:20,234
Ahh.

177
00:14:21,026 --> 00:14:23,529
Kung dahil do'n, kaya ko
naman ang sarili ko, eh.

178
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:24,697
Tsaka…

179
00:14:26,615 --> 00:14:27,491
Nagustuhan ko 'yon.

180
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:31,078
Na ikaw 'yon nu'ng araw na 'yon…

181
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:33,747
at hindi mo 'ko tinulak palayo.

182
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:35,457
Nagustuhan ko.

183
00:14:45,634 --> 00:14:49,805
Okay sa 'kin 'yan. 'Yung love na 'di
pinapansin ang agwat ng isa't isa.

184
00:14:50,723 --> 00:14:54,018
Pero ba't si Jae-i ang pinili
mo? Marami naman do'ng iba ah.

185
00:14:54,351 --> 00:14:55,269
Maganda s'ya eh.

186
00:14:55,853 --> 00:14:56,353
Ha?

187
00:14:58,105 --> 00:14:59,565
Dahil nu'ng araw na 'yon,

188
00:15:00,065 --> 00:15:00,983
s'ya ang…

189
00:15:02,443 --> 00:15:03,819
pinakamaganda sa lahat.

190
00:15:08,657 --> 00:15:09,742
Yon lang?

191
00:15:11,619 --> 00:15:15,080
Sinugal mo'ng buhay mo dahil
lang nagagandahan ka sa kanya?

192
00:15:29,845 --> 00:15:32,097
Parang kailangang gawin 'ko 'to, Jae-i.

193
00:15:32,181 --> 00:15:33,015
I'm sorry.

194
00:15:33,974 --> 00:15:34,934
Sa kahit ano.

195
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:38,270
Gusto kong mag-sorry sa lahat-lahat.

196
00:15:51,742 --> 00:15:53,452
Oh, ang cool 'di ba?

197
00:15:55,162 --> 00:15:56,330
Bagay 'yan sa 'yo.

198
00:15:56,664 --> 00:15:58,332
Tara. Isasakay kita.

199
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:00,042
Tara?

200
00:16:08,634 --> 00:16:09,718
Nakunan ko lahat.

201
00:16:27,861 --> 00:16:28,821
Ano'ng kinakain mo?

202
00:16:29,321 --> 00:16:30,531
Ice cream.

203
00:16:30,614 --> 00:16:33,617
-Nagso-solo ka d'yan? Isa lang kutsara?
-O, heto lapit.

204
00:16:34,994 --> 00:16:35,536
"Ah."

205
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:37,746
Lumapit ka pa dito.

206
00:16:38,831 --> 00:16:40,249
-Dali na.
-"Ah". Dito.

207
00:16:40,374 --> 00:16:41,542
Kaasar 'to!

208
00:16:41,875 --> 00:16:42,251
Hoy!

209
00:16:42,751 --> 00:16:43,502
Ikaw ah!

210
00:16:45,462 --> 00:16:47,006
-Daya.
-Ah!

211
00:16:47,506 --> 00:16:48,173
Yan.

212
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:51,218
Talo ka na.

213
00:16:52,052 --> 00:16:53,470
Nang-aagaw ka ng pagkain eh.

214
00:16:54,096 --> 00:16:55,597
Teka lang, ice cream o ako?

215
00:16:56,181 --> 00:16:57,182
Ice cream.

216
00:16:57,641 --> 00:16:58,392
Hoy~.

217
00:16:59,727 --> 00:17:01,186
-Ibabalik ko naman.
-Wag!

218
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:04,273
"Ah."

219
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:06,900
Ah. Nganga pa. Lumapit ka kasi.

220
00:17:07,276 --> 00:17:07,943
Ah.

221
00:17:08,444 --> 00:17:09,445
Ano ba?

222
00:17:09,945 --> 00:17:10,863
Sino ba'ng mali?

223
00:17:11,113 --> 00:17:12,156
Ako nga'ng mali.

224
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:13,824
-Inaamin mo?
-Oo, inaamin ko.

225
00:17:13,907 --> 00:17:14,950
Pero, saglit.

226
00:17:15,284 --> 00:17:15,784
O, bakit?

227
00:17:16,326 --> 00:17:18,579
Mananakit ka talaga dahil lang sa pagkain?

228
