00:51:21,328 --> 00:51:23,080
Ahh, 'yung scholar na maangas?

682
00:51:24,289 --> 00:51:25,582
Ba't mo natanong 'yan?

683
00:51:29,586 --> 00:51:30,629
Mag-ingat kayo ah.

684
00:51:30,837 --> 00:51:33,090
Ingat kayo pauwi, ha!

685
00:51:40,055 --> 00:51:42,682
Ginagaya mo ba 'yung mga gangster scenes?

686
00:51:44,351 --> 00:51:45,393
Hindi ka na galit?

687
00:51:47,521 --> 00:51:48,438
Hindi na.

688
00:51:49,606 --> 00:51:51,858
Kung inaantok ka, do'n ka na sa kama.

689
00:51:52,400 --> 00:51:53,235
Oh.

690
00:51:53,735 --> 00:51:55,237
Hindi. Hindi ako inaantok.

691
00:51:59,991 --> 00:52:03,745
Hindi ba kakagaling mo lang sa
shooting ngayon? Pagod ka na ata.

692
00:52:22,556 --> 00:52:25,142
Kahit ako, hindi ko naman ayaw 'yon.

693
00:52:26,768 --> 00:52:27,602
Hmm?

694
00:52:30,397 --> 00:52:32,899
Nu'ng araw na 'yon,
nu'ng hinalikan mo 'ko…

695
00:52:36,736 --> 00:52:38,488
Kahit ako, hindi ko ayaw 'yon.

696
00:53:30,081 --> 00:53:31,875
Magkasama sila? Saan?

697
00:53:34,961 --> 00:53:38,465
Sa villa ni Jae-i. Nakita
kong sabay sila pumasok.

698
00:53:38,798 --> 00:53:39,674
Sabay?

699
00:53:42,636 --> 00:53:43,553
Sure ka?

700
00:53:44,304 --> 00:53:44,888
Oo.

701
00:53:45,889 --> 00:53:47,349
Nakita ko silang pumasok.

702
00:53:51,144 --> 00:53:52,062
Tingin ko--

703
00:53:58,985 --> 00:54:00,195
Babalik din ako agad.

704
00:54:01,279 --> 00:54:02,113
Sige.

705
00:54:04,282 --> 00:54:05,951
Nasa'n ka, Headmistress Park?

706
00:54:07,160 --> 00:54:09,746
Pumunta ka dito. 'Yung
master key dalhin mo.

707
00:54:49,661 --> 00:54:50,412
Tutulungan kita.

708
00:55:19,607 --> 00:55:20,692
Ano 'ng nangyayari?

709
00:55:22,736 --> 00:55:23,987
Ano'ng ginagawa mo rito?!

710
00:56:02,859 --> 00:56:06,696
PERSONAL INFORMATION RECORD
KANG HA

711
00:56:46,111 --> 00:56:47,028
Sila ang…

712
00:56:48,196 --> 00:56:49,489
pinakamalala sa lahat.

713
00:56:49,989 --> 00:56:52,325
Hm? May multo palang nagsasalita?

714
00:56:52,659 --> 00:56:56,121
Ba't naman pumasok ka pa?
Mae-expel ka rin naman ngayon.

715
00:56:56,287 --> 00:56:57,038
Narinig ko nga.

716
00:56:57,247 --> 00:57:00,417
Scholar ka lang pero ang lakas ng
loob mong pasukin 'yung kwarto ni Jae-i?

717
00:57:00,500 --> 00:57:03,628
Wow, akala ko tuta ka
lang, stalker pala talaga.

718
00:57:03,711 --> 00:57:05,755
-Gosh, nakakatakot naman.
-Hoy, magkano nga 'yung pustahan

719
00:57:05,839 --> 00:57:08,925
-natin? Five million ba? Ah, sampu.
-Wala 'kong alam na gano'n ah.

720
00:57:09,008 --> 00:57:10,510
Gutom na 'ko talaga. Burger tayo?

721
00:57:10,593 --> 00:57:12,137
Uy, 'yun 'yung scholar
oh. 'Yung nag-eskandalo daw…

722
00:57:12,220 --> 00:57:13,388
Ri-an. Sa'n ka?

723
00:57:13,721 --> 00:57:16,266
-Hindi ko talaga alam pa'no i-solve 'to…
-Do'n sa disciplinary hearing ba? Tara.

724
00:57:16,349 --> 00:57:17,183
Tara.

725
00:57:18,268 --> 00:57:19,269
Game ako.

726
00:57:19,769 --> 00:57:20,645
Game sa ano?

727
00:57:20,770 --> 00:57:22,981
Yung relationship na offer mo sa 'kin.

728
00:57:23,773 --> 00:57:24,357
Game ako.

729
00:57:35,869 --> 00:57:40,123
Inaakusahan ka ng panghihimasok sa kwarto
ni Miss Jung Jae-i nu'ng Healing

730
00:57:40,206 --> 00:57:41,416
Forest field trip.

731
00:57:41,916 --> 00:57:42,876
Totoo ba, Mr. Kang Ha?

732
00:57:44,752 --> 00:57:45,879
Sagutin mo 'yung tanong!

733
00:57:46,004 --> 00:57:47,797
Hindi na kailangang tanungin pa s'ya.

734
00:57:47,881 --> 00:57:49,340
Dahil ako mismo ang nakakita.

735
00:57:50,341 --> 00:57:53,136
Ipaliwanag mo man lang kung
pa'no 'yon nangyari, Kang Ha.

736
00:57:53,219 --> 00:57:54,053
Pag ginawa ko 'yon,

737
00:57:56,181 --> 00:57:57,599
maniniwala ba kayo sa 'kin?

738
00:57:58,725 --> 00:57:59,684
Dito sa Jooshin,

739
00:57:59,809 --> 00:58:02,145
mahigpit naming sinusunod
ang rules ng eskwelahan

740
00:58:02,228 --> 00:58:03,855
higit sa iba pang school sa Korea.

741
00:58:04,814 --> 00:58:09,027
Wala kaming ibibigay na anumang awa sa
estudyanteng walang bakas ng pagsisisi.

742
00:58:10,195 --> 00:58:11,905
Ayon sa Article 12 ng eskwelahan,

743
00:58:11,988 --> 00:58:15,158
dahil sa pagdungis sa dangal
ng Jooshin High na ginawa mo,

744
00:58:15,283 --> 00:58:19,245
ipinapatupad namin ang pag-expel
kay Kang Ha ng 2nd year, Class 2.

745
00:58:21,831 --> 00:58:24,542
Hindi s'ya nanghimasok.
Pinapunta ko s'ya ro'n.

746
00:58:26,002 --> 00:58:26,711
Miss Jae-i.

747
00:58:27,545 --> 00:58:28,880
Meron akong pinadala sa
kanya no'n sa kwarto ko.

748
00:58:28,963 --> 00:58:31,299
'Yon lang ang nangyari at wala nang iba.

749
00:58:31,424 --> 00:58:33,718
Kaya kung meron kayong dapat parusahan,

750
00:58:34,469 --> 00:58:35,428
ako ang taong 'yon.

751
00:58:36,888 --> 00:58:37,555
Tara na.

752
00:58:38,848 --> 00:58:39,432
Uh-- saglit--

753
00:58:42,977 --> 00:58:43,895
Rule breaker s'ya.

754
00:58:45,230 --> 00:58:46,940
Magre-request sana 'ko
ng mas malalang parusa

755
00:58:47,023 --> 00:58:49,108
para mabalik ang kaayusan sa school.

756
00:58:50,485 --> 00:58:51,361
Ano'ng ginagawa mo?

757
00:58:53,404 --> 00:58:55,198
Tinatanong pa kita, sumagot ka.

758
00:58:57,158 --> 00:58:58,159
[INHALES}

759
00:58:59,744 --> 00:59:01,746
Mula ngayon lubayan mo si Kang Ha.

760
00:59:03,039 --> 00:59:03,873
Ha?

761
00:59:04,123 --> 00:59:05,500
Hindi ko s'ya ginagamit.

762
00:59:05,833 --> 00:59:06,834
Seryoso ako.

763
00:59:12,840 --> 00:59:13,967
Gusto ko s'ya, - Ri-an.

764
00:59:18,972 --> 00:59:21,266
Kaya magmula ngayon lubayan mo na s'ya.

765
00:59:21,933 --> 00:59:22,892
Sandali.

766
00:59:26,062 --> 00:59:28,690
Nasa Jooshin ka, Jung Jae-i.

767
00:59:30,817 --> 00:59:32,735
Do'n ka lang sa kaya mong panindigan.

768
00:59:33,570 --> 00:59:35,196
Sa Jooshin man o kahit saan,

769
00:59:37,323 --> 00:59:39,450
ako si Jung Jae-i, Kim Ri-an.

770
01:00:03,933 --> 01:00:05,018
Ba't mo ginawa 'yon?

771
01:00:13,860 --> 01:00:15,445
Kaya ko namang harapin 'yon.

772
01:00:15,778 --> 01:00:18,948
Dahil dito pag-usapan ka ng
mga tao, eh dahil sa 'kin.

773
01:00:19,115 --> 01:00:20,033
Kang Ha.

774
01:00:23,453 --> 01:00:24,787
Ano'ng motibo mo dito?

775
01:00:38,635 --> 01:00:41,512
Alam mo na pala… kung sino 'ko talaga.

